      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DR. WILDMAN (1) finished third (24.57) two back at Sale but out of the placings last time when 8th there. Has ability and looks hard to stop. PAW NINA (7) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 8 lengths into second (23.35) at Geelong in a Bottom Up - Maiden over 400m. Can measure up. DR. TANYA (4) has an honest record despite remaining a maiden and overdue for a win, having placed 16 of 54 career runs. Returns to a favourable course. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from nine attempts. Expected to feature again. ROSATO (8) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
